# Cargo build output. Each of the rig's four crates (root, canary/, rig/, fuzz/)
# produces its own target/, and the canary alone is ~465MB after one release
# build. Nothing here was ignored before, so a `git add -A` in this directory
# would have tried to commit all of it.
target/
**/target/

# cargo-fuzz corpora and artifacts: regenerable, and large.
fuzz/corpus/
fuzz/artifacts/
fuzz/coverage/
